30,2,1,talk,Sakura,,"All-in rates mean everyone pays the same regardless of appetite, but separate rooms last time had a huge price difference between us!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,1,talk,Victoria,,"The island houses are quite cheap per head, but the valley inns are more expensive since they include breakfast and dinner.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,1,talk,Midori,,"It seems last year we were too separate, but in a shared house, there was absolutely no privacy for anyone.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,1,talk,Toshio,,The ferry takes two whole days of our trip. The train to the spa valley is only ninety minutes.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,The inn has strict mealtimes and we'd all be in one room on futons. The island houses only have one bathroom.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Victoria, if the island is cheaper, maybe we should go there? But I don't want people paying different amounts for rooms.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Sakura, a whole house would be one bill divided evenly. But @Toshio, two days of travel sounds excessive.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,2,talk,Midori,,"If we want a balance of togetherness and space, a town might be better than a single house.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"Exactly. The city is the most efficient for movement, and the spa town is much faster to reach than the island.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,I don't like the idea of one bathroom for all of us. And one big room for sleeping sounds... stressful.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,3,talk,Sakura,,"@Daisuke, would a city break be better? Everyone gets their own room?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,3,talk,Victoria,,City beds are the most expensive and meals are extra. It's the least predictable for the total budget.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,3,talk,Midori,,"A city break might lead to us drifting apart again, like last year.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,3,talk,Toshio,,The spa town seems like a middle ground. Fast travel and a central place to stay.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,"@Toshio, but the futons in one room... I might not sleep well.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,4,talk,Sakura,,I just want it to be fair! A single bill is easiest.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,4,talk,Victoria,,"The spa town is expensive, but the meals are included. It's more predictable than the city.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,4,talk,Midori,,Let's consider if the spa town allows for some quiet time while keeping us together.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,4,talk,Toshio,,It's better than wasting two days on a ferry.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,"I suppose the bath hours at the inn are very flexible, which is good.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
