55,3,1,talk,Sakura,,I'm leaning towards the Island Trip because the bill is shared evenly.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,3,1,talk,Victoria,,I prefer the Hot Spring Town. The all-in rate prevents surprises later.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,1,talk,Midori,,I think the Hot Spring Town is best. It balances the group's needs.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,1,talk,Toshio,,I vote for the Hot Spring Town. The travel time is the most reasonable.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,1,talk,Daisuke,,I'll vote for the City Break. I really need my own room to sleep.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Daisuke, are you sure? We won't be together as much!","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,2,talk,Victoria,,The City Break is too financially volatile.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
