64,3,2,talk,Daisuke,,I'm just worried about the sleeping arrangements.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,3,talk,Sakura,,"Maybe I'll change to the Hot Spring Town too, if everyone else wants it.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,3,talk,Victoria,,It is the most rational choice for the budget.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,3,talk,Midori,,I'm glad we're agreeing.,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,3,talk,Toshio,,It's the most efficient use of our time.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,3,talk,Daisuke,,If you all really want it... I'll try to manage.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,4,talk,Sakura,,Yay! We decided!,"{""words"":3,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
